# Phase 12 — Trade Memory journal. Local runtime data written by the API; the
# saved trades are the user's own and are never committed.
#
# This also covers the two files real authentication writes:
#   server/data/users.json    — accounts, each with a scrypt password hash
#   server/data/sessions.json — open sessions, each stored as a token digest
# Neither may ever be committed: the first is a credential store, and the second
# is the set of live sign-ins.
server/data/

# WorkBuddy internal workspace files (never commit these)
.workbuddy-ai/

# Screenshots produced by the visual harnesses (scripts/shots-visual.mjs,
# scripts/verify-visual-redesign.mjs). They are review artefacts — regenerated
# on demand, and they carry a real trader's on-screen data, so they must not
# enter the repository.
.visual-shots/

# Scratch files used while editing the stylesheet in bulk.
.tmp-*.css
.tmp-*.py
